'''When Life Gives You Lemons''' is [[Challenges|challenge]] #12. {{c|Isaac}} is the default character for the challenge, and he starts with {{i|Lemon Mishap}}, {{i|9 Volt}}, {{i|Habit}}, and a [[Lemon Party]] pill. The goal is to defeat {{E|Mom}}. This challenge is available by default.

== Difficulty ==
The lack of {{R|Treasure Room}}s makes this challenge much more difficult than a normal run.

== Strategy ==
* Lemon Mishap has a small range, making it difficult to use. The Habit and 9 Volt will allow more frequent uses of it but their combination is more important than that. Because every run starts with 9 Volt, any activated item obtained will take less time to recharge. The Habit makes taking damage charge it faster as well. The only catch would be finding a better [[activated collectible]].
* The {{t|Lost Cork}} is an extremely beneficial trinket in this run, expanding the area of Lemon Mishap and thus making it safer to use since Isaac doesn't need to be as close to the enemy.
* A good item to find is {{i|Shoop da Whoop!}}, simply for being usable every room because of 9 Volt.

== Reward ==
{{achievement text | Card Against Humanity }}

== Trivia ==
* The challenge name is a reference to the proverbial phrase "When life gives you lemons, make lemonade."
* One of the {{M|Fortune Telling Machine}}'s fortunes is "When life gives you lemons, reroll!"

